<title>FRANCE: Cap Gemini sees 80 percent rise in net profit.</title>
<headline>Cap Gemini sees 80 percent rise in net profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Software engineering group Cap Gemini said on Tuesday that 1997 net attributable profit could be 80 percent higher than the 282 million it recorded in 1996.</p>
<p>It added in a statement it expected sales to exceed 19 billion francs and its operating margin to rise to eight percent from seven percent.</p>
